        "text_ga8LCz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>The OTG Falcon Ski Goggles are designed for glasses wearers, offering a large, frameless, spherical lens for an unobstructed view. With 100% UV400 protection, anti-fog coating, and durable anti-scratch performance, these goggles ensure clear vision in any weather.</h4><h4><strong>Comfortable Over-The-Glasses Fit</strong></h4><h4>The OTG design accommodates prescription glasses, fitting comfortably over eyewear up to 5.5 inches wide and 1.9 inches high. Perfect for men, women, and youth aged 10+.</h4><h4><strong>Helmet Compatible & Secure Fit</strong></h4><h4>Featuring an adjustable non-slip strap, these goggles are compatible with any ski helmet. The flexible TPU frame ensures durability and comfort for long days on the slopes.</h4><h4><strong>Risk-Free Purchase</strong></h4><h4>Enjoy peace of mind with our 30-day replacement or refund guarantee. Experience the ultimate in skiing comfort with OTG Falcon.</h4>"
          }
